  [ 12] extcall 8 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 14] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 16] thebuiltin 24 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 20] extcall 16 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 22] ret
end
